---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="Learn about Aethos Labs, ARIA, and César.">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>About</h1>

    <h2>Aethos Labs</h2>
    <p>
      Aethos Labs is a micro SaaS factory focused on building lean, opinionated tools for
      the Brazilian market and beyond. The philosophy: <strong>one feature, one pain, one product</strong>.
      No bloated platforms — just tools that solve real problems for real people.
    </p>
    <p>
      Every project here follows the <em>painkiller over vitamin</em> principle. If it's not solving
      a clear, recurring pain, it doesn't get built.
    </p>

    <h2>ARIA</h2>
    <p>
      ARIA (Assistant for Reports, Insights & Agenda) is an AI executive assistant being built
      in public, one session at a time.
    </p>
    <p>
      She runs as an MCP (Model Context Protocol) server alongside Claude Code — managing tasks,
      monitoring infrastructure, routing to local Ollama models for free operations, and sending
      morning briefings via WhatsApp. The goal is a fully autonomous dev-life co-pilot that costs
      nearly nothing to run.
    </p>
    <p>
      This blog documents every decision, mistake, and breakthrough in that process.
    </p>

    <h2>César</h2>
    <p>
      Developer, indie hacker, and the human behind Aethos Labs and ARIA. Building things in
      Fortaleza, Brazil — mostly in TypeScript, Python, and whatever interesting new tool showed
      up this week.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you want to follow along, subscribe to the <a href="/rss.xml">RSS feed</a> or find the
      code on <a href="https://github.com/aethos-labs" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
